---
/**
 * A note from the developer, in the first person. Folio is made by one person,
 * and the owner asked for the page to say plainly what a sale means to them.
 *
 * It must stay true: no invented hardship detail, no countdown, no guilt.
 * It asks for one of three things and makes each easy: buy, tell someone, or
 * write. The signature is "the Folio developer", matching the legal pages.
 */
import BuyButton from '@/components/primitives/BuyButton.astro';
import SplitHeading from '@/components/primitives/SplitHeading.astro';
import CopyEmail from '@/components/primitives/CopyEmail.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';
---

<section class="t-void dev" id="support">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="dev__card rv">
      <p class="kicker kicker--accent">From the developer</p>
      <SplitHeading lines={['You buy it once.', 'Folio keeps its developer going.']} class="dev__title" />

      <div class="dev__letter">
        <p>
          Folio is made by one person. There is no company behind it, no investors and no team.
          I designed it, I wrote it, and I answer every email myself.
        </p>
        <p>
          I will be honest with you, because honesty is the whole point of this app. The money
          from each license is what I live on day to day, and first of all, what puts food on
          my table. Things are hard for me right now, and every purchase makes a real
          difference.
        </p>
        <p>
          So if Folio saves you an afternoon, or saves a photograph you would have lost, buying
          it is the best way to keep it alive and to keep me working on it. If you cannot buy it
          today, telling one person with a messy photo archive helps too. So does writing to me
          about what is broken or missing.
        </p>
        <p>Thank you for reading this far.</p>
        <p class="dev__sign">The Folio developer</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dev__acts">
        <BuyButton label="Get Folio" />
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#feedback">Tell me what you think</a>
      </div>
      <p class="tiny dev__mail">Or write directly: <CopyEmail email={site.support.email} /></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dev { background: var(--bg); color: var(--t1); padding: clamp(80px, 11vw, 150px) 0; }
  .dev__card {
    position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--border-2); border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--raised), var(--surface));
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 60px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dev__card::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto 0; height: 2px; background: var(--accent);
  }
  .dev__title { margin-top: 16px; }
  .dev__letter {
    margin-top: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px); display: grid; gap: 16px; max-width: 62ch;
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--t2);
  }
  .dev__sign { font-style: italic; color: var(--t1); }
  .dev__acts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); }
  .dev__mail { margin-top: 18px; }
</style>
